        {
          "id": "789b96ea-0a64-4dfa-bb3c-6e23aa9b5828",
          "name": "GET Deactivate MFA Device",
          "request": {
            "name": "GET Deactivate MFA Device",
            "description": {
              "content": "<p>Deactivates the specified MFA device and removes it from association with the user name for which it was originally enabled.</p> <p>For more information about creating and working with virtual MFA devices, see <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/IAM/latest/UserGuide/Using_VirtualMFA.html\">Enabling a virtual multi-factor authentication (MFA) device</a> in the <i>IAM User Guide</i>.</p>",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                ""
              ],
              "hash": "Action=DeactivateMFADevice",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "UserName",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) <p>The name of the user whose MFA device you want to deactivate.</p> <p>This parameter allows (through its <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/regex\">regex pattern</a>) a string of characters consisting of upper and lowercase alphanumeric characters with no spaces. You can also include any of the following characters: _+=,.@-</p>"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "SerialNumber",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) <p>The serial number that uniquely identifies the MFA device. For virtual MFA devices, the serial number is the device ARN.</p> <p>This parameter allows (through its <a href=\"http://wikipedia.org/wiki/regex\">regex pattern</a>) a string of characters consisting of upper and lowercase alphanumeric characters with no spaces. You can also include any of the following characters: =,.@:/-</p>"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "Action",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) "
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "Version",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) "
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
